<title>POLAND: POLAND'S SECOND SUGAR BEET TEST RESULTS ON TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>POLAND'S SECOND SUGAR BEET TEST RESULTS ON TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The results of Poland's second sugar beet test, sheduled to be released after October 20, will be announced on Tuesday, the Sugar Industry Institute (IPC) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The IPC held its second and last 1996 sugar beet test on October 7.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
